ed\", false)` works correctly\n\nThis should be documented in the 3D case like it is in the 2D case","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631765621/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631778153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102377#issuecomment-2631778153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102377","id":2631778153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c3b9p","user":{"login":"amarraff","id":35876526,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODc2NTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35876526?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff","html_url":"https://github.com/amarraff","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarraff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T18:40:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T18:40:26Z","body":"> You need to call it deferred, as per the error message you get:\n> \n> ```\n> E 0:00:05:0537   toggler.gd:25 @ _enable_collision_shape(): Can't change this state while flushing queries. Use call_deferred() or set_deferred() to change monitoring state instead.\n>   <C++ Error>    Condition \"body->get_space() && flushing_queries\" is true.\n>   <C++ Source>   modules/godot_physics_3d/godot_physics_server_3d.cpp:540 @ body_set_shape_disabled()\n>   <Stack Trace>  toggler.gd:25 @ _enable_collision_shape()\n>                  toggler.gd:35 @ _on_area_3d_body_entered()\n> ```\n> \n> Changing it to `collision_shape_3d.set_deferred(&\"disabled\", false)` works correctly\n> \n> This should be documented in the 3D case like it is in the 2D case\n\nThat fixed it for me, thank you! I agree, documenting it would be a good idea.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631778153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631778919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102377#issuecomment-2631778919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102377","id":2631778919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c3cJn","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_u